Group gWateringZones

String VT_Watering_Zone1 (gWateringZones)
String VT_Watering_Zone2 (gWateringZones)
Number VT_Watering_Duration "Bewässerungsdauer [%d s]"
Number VT_Watering_Interval "Bewässerungsintervall [%d Tage]"

Switch SomeCondition

// Relais pro Zone, werden von der Watering Service Regel angesteuert
Switch Zone1_Relay "Ventil Zone 1 [%s]"
Switch Zone2_Relay "Ventil Zone 2 [%s]"
